## Building Features

### File Structure

```
apps/app/src/app/[feature]/
├── page.tsx           # Server Component (static shell + Suspense)
├── client.tsx         # Client Component (data fetching with useQuery)
└── loading.tsx        # Optional loading skeleton

apps/app/src/services/
└── [feature].service.ts  # TanStack Query hooks + query keys

apps/auth-server/src/modules/[feature]/
├── index.ts           # Elysia route handlers
└── model.ts           # Zod schemas + types
```

